  dialogueText: "Thank the gods, an adventurer! Dreadful screeching echoes from my
    cellar\u2014giant rats are ruining my finest wine casks! Will you clear them
    out before the whole village dies of thirst?"
  options:
  - optionText: I'll purge your cellar right away.
